  "song": "mukta-m0-p10",
  "verse": 232,
  "plain_english": "Just as, in regard to their objects and results, it shines forth by following upon them.",
  "sanskrit_cite": "yathā meyaphale tāsāṃ tadanūdya prakāśate",
